# The bearer token is NOT here and must never be. AGENTDECK_TOKEN_FILE decides where it goes, and
# there is no container and no mount left to place it behind: agentdeck runs on the Mac as you.
# Where it should now live is undecided - recorded as open in plan 005's superseded header. The
# one rule that survives de-containerising is that it is never at the root of a tree a session is
# pointed at, where an agent's own `ls -la` or `grep -rn token .` meets it.

